	"_secret_comment": "This world's one SECRET (docs/home-world-and-secrets-design.md, 'Glyphfall'). reveal.type 'misprint': the character cell holding 'position' shows reveal.glyph (an ampersand) in place of grass, in the grass's own colour. As the player passes within the notice range (wider with bond) the companion stops and looks at it for 'notice_hold' seconds, again after a cooldown (shorter with bond, and nearer). Once it has noticed and the player comes within 'find_radius', the glyph catches the light and can be examined (GlyphNotice / MisprintDirector). The prop's type is 'unseen': the page draws it, not WorldArt. The server honours a claim only here, within 'radius' of 'position'.",
